# Bin RGB Table -- format: BinNo,R,G,B (0-255)
# Any value out of 0-255 => not configured (falls back to default color)
# Copy this file to BinRGBTable.Data next to the exe to activate.
# Example:
# 0,255,0,0        # bin 0 = pure red
# 1,0,255,0        # bin 1 = pure green
# 2,255,128,0      # bin 2 = orange
